{"3014660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NO FURTHER ACTIONS", "steam_appid": 3014660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No context. No explanation. <br>Only a desk, a set of controls, and a constant stream of protocols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You read documents. <br>You press buttons. <br>You make decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the system responds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every protocol requires action — even when the information is incomplete. <br>Some instructions contradict each other. <br>Some feel insignificant. <br>None can be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not here to understand. <br>You are here to comply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/76f851f9d5b87c472f7686932baca5ae.poster.avif?t=1787780953\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/76f851f9d5b87c472f7686932baca5ae.webm?t=1787780953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/76f851f9d5b87c472f7686932baca5ae.mp4?t=1787780953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SYSTEM THAT WATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system reacts to everything you do. <br>Not always immediately. Not always clearly. <br>But it keeps track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequences unfold over time. <br>Patterns emerge. <br>Doubt grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin to question not just your decisions — <br>but the system itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read and interpret incoming protocols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions using physical controls (buttons and switches)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle incomplete and conflicting information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face delayed and evolving consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue working — even when things stop making sense</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every processed document disappears. <br>There is no going back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological experience focused on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncertainty and interpretation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsibility without clarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The illusion of control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, systemic tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No upgrades. No clear answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/79521c86754f1d2121df6dbcb2fc086f.poster.avif?t=1787780953\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/79521c86754f1d2121df6dbcb2fc086f.webm?t=1787780953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/79521c86754f1d2121df6dbcb2fc086f.mp4?t=1787780953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person, desk-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven system with persistent consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI, fully diegetic interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive atmosphere with subtle dark humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for focused, immersive play sessions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are expected to do your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you understand it — is not required.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No context. No explanation. <br>Only a desk, a set of controls, and a constant stream of protocols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You read documents. <br>You press buttons. <br>You make decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the system responds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every protocol requires action — even when the information is incomplete. <br>Some instructions contradict each other. <br>Some feel insignificant. <br>None can be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not here to understand. <br>You are here to comply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/76f851f9d5b87c472f7686932baca5ae.poster.avif?t=1787780953\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/76f851f9d5b87c472f7686932baca5ae.webm?t=1787780953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014660/extras/76f851f9d5b87c472f7686932baca5ae.mp4?t=1787780953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SYSTEM THAT WATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system reacts to everything you do. <br>Not always immediately. Not always clearly. <br>But it keeps trac